{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122948","id":4387857537,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBYlkgQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122948","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122948.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122948.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122948","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122948/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122948/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122948/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/966570f024bf14a879d7f2015a6bf53f706679d4","number":122948,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix wrong type for custom performance monitors added at runtime","user":{"login":"christianaurichzm","id":36874062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODc0MDYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36874062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm","html_url":"https://github.com/christianaurichzm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianaurichzm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #122917. Diagnosis by @Chriz-code in the issue; this PR is their suggested fix, verified with before/after builds.\r\n\r\n`EditorPerformanceProfiler::update_monitors()` receives the custom monitor names and their types as two arrays indexed the same way. It first records each monitor's index in `names` as `Performance::MONITOR_MAX + i`, then removes from\r\n`names` every monitor it is already tracking (refreshing only their `frame_index`), and finally creates the remaining ones while walking a separate counter that starts at zero:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nPerformance::MonitorType type = Performance::MonitorType(p_types[index]);\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnce an already-tracked monitor has been filtered out, that counter no longer corresponds to the new monitor's own index in `p_types`, and the monitor is created with the type of whichever one sits at that offset.\r\n\r\nThe `names` map already carries that index, so it can be used directly:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nPerformance::MonitorType type = Performance::MonitorType(p_types[E.value - Performance::MONITOR_MAX]);\r\n```\r\n\r\n`E.value - MONITOR_MAX` is the `i` the entry was inserted with, so it always falls within `[0, p_names.size())`.\r\n\r\nIntroduced in 1a8306bbc1 (\"Allow custom monitors to select desired type\"), which matches the issue being reproducible from 4.6 onwards.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nThe debugger polls custom monitor names only once per second (`RemoteDebugger::PerformanceProfiler::tick()`), so the monitors have to be registered in separate polls for the offsets to shift.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n    Performance.add_custom_monitor(&\"Repro/A\", func(): return 1.0, [], Performance.MONITOR_TYPE_TIME)\r\n    await get_tree().create_timer(1.5).timeout\r\n    Performance.add_custom_monitor(&\"Repro/B\", func(): return 1.0, [], Performance.MONITOR_TYPE_PERCENTAGE)\r\n    await get_tree().create_timer(1.5).timeout\r\n    Performance.add_custom_monitor(&\"Repro/C\", func(): return 5.0 * 1024 * 1024, [], Performance.MONITOR_TYPE_MEMORY)\r\n```\r\n\r\nRun the project and open **Debugger > Monitors**:\r\n\r\n| Monitor | Type passed | Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `A` | `TIME` | `1000.00 ms` | `1000.00 ms` |\r\n| `B` | `PERCENTAGE` | `1000.00 ms` | `100.00%` |\r\n| `C` | `MEMORY` | `5242880000.00 ms` | `5.00 MiB` |","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user